{"id":"8428176690b5f885","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/555_一阶模态逻辑_FOML.md","title":"555 一阶模态逻辑 FOML","display":"555_一阶模态逻辑_FOML","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始签名与显示约定\">1. 原始签名与显示约定</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\\quad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:k\\to X\\ (Y=\\{e(i):i&lt;k\\})\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Var}_{555}=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\\quad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:k\\to X\\ (Y=\\{e(i):i&lt;k\\})\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Var}_{555}=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>一阶签名为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_{555}=(\\mathcal F_{555},\\mathcal R_{555},\\operatorname{arF}_{555},\\operatorname{arR}_{555}),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Sigma_{555}=(\\mathcal F_{555},\\mathcal R_{555},\\operatorname{arF}_{555},\\operatorname{arR}_{555}),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F_{555}\\cap\\mathcal R_{555}=\\varnothing,\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{arF}_{555}:\\mathcal F_{555}\\to\\mathbb N,\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{arR}_{555}:\\mathcal R_{555}\\to\\mathbb N.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal F_{555}\\cap\\mathcal R_{555}=\\varnothing,\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{arF}_{555}:\\mathcal F_{555}\\to\\mathbb N,\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{arR}_{555}:\\mathcal R_{555}\\to\\mathbb N.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>原始项构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{var},\\operatorname{fun}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{var},\\operatorname{fun}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>原始逻辑构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{rel},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{all},\\operatorname{box}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{rel},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{all},\\operatorname{box}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>本条目没有等词原子；等词不是本文件的公式构造子。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-项与公式\">2. 项与公式</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Tm}_{555}\">\\(\\mathsf{Tm}_{555}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{555}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{555}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{var}(x)\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{555}\">\\(\\operatorname{var}(x)\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{555}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathcal F_{555}\">\\(f\\in\\mathcal F_{555}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{arF}_{555}(f)=n\">\\(\\operatorname{arF}_{555}(f)=n\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau:n\\to\\mathsf{Tm}_{555}\">\\(\\tau:n\\to\\mathsf{Tm}_{555}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fun}(f,\\tau)\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{555}\">\\(\\operatorname{fun}(f,\\tau)\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{555}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{555}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{555}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in\\mathcal R_{555}\">\\(R\\in\\mathcal R_{555}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{arR}_{555}(R)=n\">\\(\\operatorname{arR}_{555}(R)=n\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau:n\\to\\mathsf{Tm}_{555}\">\\(\\tau:n\\to\\mathsf{Tm}_{555}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{rel}(R,\\tau)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{555}\">\\(\\operatorname{rel}(R,\\tau)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{555}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{555}\">\\(\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{555}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{555}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{555}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{555}\">\\(\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{555}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{555}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{555}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{555}\">\\(A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{555}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{555}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{555}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{555}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{555}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall xA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{555}\">\\(\\forall xA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{555}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{555}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{555}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{555}\">\\(\\Box A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{555}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变量、替换与-$\\alpha$-等价\">3. 自由变量、替换与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>-等价</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FVt}_{555}:\\mathsf{Tm}_{555}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Var}_{555}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{555}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{555}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Var}_{555}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FVt}_{555}:\\mathsf{Tm}_{555}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Var}_{555}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{555}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{555}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Var}_{555}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FVt}_{555}(\\operatorname{var}(x))=\\{x\\},\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FVt}_{555}(\\operatorname{fun}(f,\\tau))=\\bigcup_{i&lt;n}\\operatorname{FVt}_{555}(\\tau(i)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FVt}_{555}(\\operatorname{var}(x))=\\{x\\},\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FVt}_{555}(\\operatorname{fun}(f,\\tau))=\\bigcup_{i&lt;n}\\operatorname{FVt}_{555}(\\tau(i)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{555}(\\operatorname{rel}(R,\\tau))=\\bigcup_{i&lt;n}\\operatorname{FVt}_{555}(\\tau(i)),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{555}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{555}(\\operatorname{rel}(R,\\tau))=\\bigcup_{i&lt;n}\\operatorname{FVt}_{555}(\\tau(i)),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{555}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{555}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{555}(A),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{555}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{555}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{555}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{555}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{555}(A),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{555}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{555}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{555}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{555}(\\forall xA)=\\operatorname{FV}_{555}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\},\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{555}(\\Box A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{555}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{555}(\\forall xA)=\\operatorname{FV}_{555}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\},\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{555}(\\Box A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{555}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>绑定变量函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{555}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{555}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Var}_{555})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{555}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{555}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Var}_{555})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{555}(\\operatorname{rel}(R,\\tau))=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{555}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{555}(\\operatorname{rel}(R,\\tau))=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{555}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{555}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{BV}_{555}(A),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{555}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{BV}_{555}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_{555}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{555}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{BV}_{555}(A),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{555}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{BV}_{555}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_{555}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{555}(\\forall xA)=\\{x\\}\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_{555}(A),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{555}(\\Box A)=\\operatorname{BV}_{555}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{555}(\\forall xA)=\\{x\\}\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_{555}(A),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{555}(\\Box A)=\\operatorname{BV}_{555}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义新鲜变量函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fresh}_{555}:\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Var}_{555})\\to\\mathsf{Var}_{555},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{fresh}_{555}:\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Var}_{555})\\to\\mathsf{Var}_{555},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fresh}_{555}(X)=v_m\">\\(\\operatorname{fresh}_{555}(X)=v_m\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m=\\min\\{i:v_i\\notin X\\}\">\\(m=\\min\\{i:v_i\\notin X\\}\\)</span>。项替换函数为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Subt}_{555}:\n\\mathsf{Tm}_{555}\\times\\mathsf{Var}_{555}\\times\\mathsf{Tm}_{555}\n\\to\\mathsf{Tm}_{555}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Subt}_{555}:\n\\mathsf{Tm}_{555}\\times\\mathsf{Var}_{555}\\times\\mathsf{Tm}_{555}\n\\to\\mathsf{Tm}_{555}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{var}(y)[x:=t]=\n\\begin{cases}\nt,&amp;y=x,\\\\\n\\operatorname{var}(y),&amp;y\\ne x,\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{var}(y)[x:=t]=\n\\begin{cases}\nt,&amp;y=x,\\\\\n\\operatorname{var}(y),&amp;y\\ne x,\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fun}(f,\\tau)[x:=t]=\\operatorname{fun}(f,\\tau&#39;)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{fun}(f,\\tau)[x:=t]=\\operatorname{fun}(f,\\tau&#39;)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau&#39;(i)=\\tau(i)[x:=t]\">\\(\\tau&#39;(i)=\\tau(i)[x:=t]\\)</span>。公式替换函数为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{555}:\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{555}\\times\\mathsf{Var}_{555}\\times\\mathsf{Tm}_{555}\n\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{555}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{555}:\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{555}\\times\\mathsf{Var}_{555}\\times\\mathsf{Tm}_{555}\n\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{555}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>它满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{rel}(R,\\tau)[x:=t]=\\operatorname{rel}(R,\\tau&#39;)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{rel}(R,\\tau)[x:=t]=\\operatorname{rel}(R,\\tau&#39;)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau&#39;(i)=\\tau(i)[x:=t]\">\\(\\tau&#39;(i)=\\tau(i)[x:=t]\\)</span>；</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bot[x:=t]=\\bot,\\quad\n(\\neg A)[x:=t]=\\neg(A[x:=t]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bot[x:=t]=\\bot,\\quad\n(\\neg A)[x:=t]=\\neg(A[x:=t]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(A\\to B)[x:=t]=A[x:=t]\\to B[x:=t],\n\\quad\n(\\Box A)[x:=t]=\\Box(A[x:=t]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(A\\to B)[x:=t]=A[x:=t]\\to B[x:=t],\n\\quad\n(\\Box A)[x:=t]=\\Box(A[x:=t]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>量词处：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\forall yB)[x:=t]=\\forall yB\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\forall yB)[x:=t]=\\forall yB\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y=x\">\\(y=x\\)</span>；</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\forall yB)[x:=t]=\\forall y(B[x:=t])\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\forall yB)[x:=t]=\\forall y(B[x:=t])\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\ne x\">\\(y\\ne x\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\notin\\operatorname{FVt}_{555}(t)\">\\(y\\notin\\operatorname{FVt}_{555}(t)\\)</span>；第三种情形为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall z((B[y:=\\operatorname{var}(z)])[x:=t]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall z((B[y:=\\operatorname{var}(z)])[x:=t]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z=\\operatorname{fresh}_{555}(\\operatorname{FV}_{555}(B)\\cup\\operatorname{FVt}_{555}(t)\\cup\\{x,y\\})\">\\(z=\\operatorname{fresh}_{555}(\\operatorname{FV}_{555}(B)\\cup\\operatorname{FVt}_{555}(t)\\cup\\{x,y\\})\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{555}(B)\\setminus\\{y\\}\">\\(z\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{555}(B)\\setminus\\{y\\}\\)</span>，定义外层绑定变量改名</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BoundRen}_{555}(\\forall yB,y,z)=\\forall z(B[y:=\\operatorname{var}(z)]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BoundRen}_{555}(\\forall yB,y,z)=\\forall z(B[y:=\\operatorname{var}(z)]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E_{555}\">\\(\\mathcal E_{555}\\)</span> 为所有二元关系</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"E\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{555}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{555}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[E\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{555}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{555}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>的集合，且每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\in\\mathcal E_{555}\">\\(E\\in\\mathcal E_{555}\\)</span> 满足：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{555}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{555}\\)</span> 上的等价关系。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in\\mathcal R_{555}\">\\(R\\in\\mathcal R_{555}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{arR}_{555}(R)=n\">\\(\\operatorname{arR}_{555}(R)=n\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau,\\rho:n\\to\\mathsf{Tm}_{555}\">\\(\\tau,\\rho:n\\to\\mathsf{Tm}_{555}\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau=\\rho\">\\(\\tau=\\rho\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\operatorname{rel}(R,\\tau),\\operatorname{rel}(R,\\rho))\\in E\">\\((\\operatorname{rel}(R,\\tau),\\operatorname{rel}(R,\\rho))\\in E\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A,B)\\in E\">\\((A,B)\\in E\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\neg A,\\neg B)\\in E\">\\((\\neg A,\\neg B)\\in E\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A_0,B_0)\\in E\">\\((A_0,B_0)\\in E\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A_1,B_1)\\in E\">\\((A_1,B_1)\\in E\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A_0\\to A_1,B_0\\to B_1)\\in E\">\\((A_0\\to A_1,B_0\\to B_1)\\in E\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A,B)\\in E\">\\((A,B)\\in E\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{555}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{555}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\forall xA,\\forall xB)\\in E\">\\((\\forall xA,\\forall xB)\\in E\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A,B)\\in E\">\\((A,B)\\in E\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\Box A,\\Box B)\\in E\">\\((\\Box A,\\Box B)\\in E\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{555}\">\\(B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{555}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y,z\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{555}\">\\(y,z\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{555}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{555}(B)\\setminus\\{y\\}\">\\(z\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{555}(B)\\setminus\\{y\\}\\)</span>，则</li>\n</ol>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigl(\\forall yB,\\operatorname{BoundRen}_{555}(\\forall yB,y,z)\\bigr)\\in E.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigl(\\forall yB,\\operatorname{BoundRen}_{555}(\\forall yB,y,z)\\bigr)\\in E.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_{\\alpha,555}=\\bigcap\\mathcal E_{555}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\equiv_{\\alpha,555}=\\bigcap\\mathcal E_{555}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-公理族\">4. 公理族</h1>\n<p>命题公理族为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{555}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{555}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{555}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{555}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{555}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{555}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{555}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{555}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{555}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{555}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{555}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{555}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>一阶量词公理族为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Q1}^{555}\n=\n\\{(\\forall xA)\\to A[x:=t]:x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{555},t\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{555},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{555}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{Q1}^{555}\n=\n\\{(\\forall xA)\\to A[x:=t]:x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{555},t\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{555},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{555}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Q2}^{555}\n=\n\\{(\\forall x(A\\to B))\\to(A\\to\\forall xB):\nx\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{555},\\ A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{555},\\ x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{555}(A)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{Q2}^{555}\n=\n\\{(\\forall x(A\\to B))\\to(A\\to\\forall xB):\nx\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{555},\\ A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{555},\\ x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{555}(A)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>模态分配公理族为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{555}\n=\n\\{\\Box(A\\to B)\\to(\\Box A\\to\\Box B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{555}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{555}\n=\n\\{\\Box(A\\to B)\\to(\\Box A\\to\\Box B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{555}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{555}=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{555}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{555}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{555}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Q1}^{555}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Q2}^{555}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{555}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{555}=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{555}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{555}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{555}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Q1}^{555}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Q2}^{555}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{555}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-推理规则\">5. 推理规则</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{555}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{555}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{555}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{555}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{Gen}^{555}=\\{((A),\\forall xA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{555},x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{555}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{Gen}^{555}=\\{((A),\\forall xA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{555},x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{555}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{555}=\\{((A),\\Box A):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{555}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{555}=\\{((A),\\Box A):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{555}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-证明对象\">6. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{555}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{555}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{555}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathsf{Proof}_{555}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 是所有非空有限序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\">\\(((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\">\\(m&gt;0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{555}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{555}\\)</span>，且每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;m\">\\(i&lt;m\\)</span> 至少满足下列 6 个条件之一：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{555}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{555}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{555}\">\\(((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{555}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{555}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{555}\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Gen}^{555}\">\\(((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Gen}^{555}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i=\\forall xA_j\">\\(A_i=\\forall xA_j\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\notin\\bigcup_{G\\in\\Gamma}\\operatorname{FV}_{555}(G)\">\\(x\\notin\\bigcup_{G\\in\\Gamma}\\operatorname{FV}_{555}(G)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{555}\">\\(((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{555}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_j\\equiv_{\\alpha,555}A_i\">\\(A_j\\equiv_{\\alpha,555}A_i\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{555}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{555}(\\Gamma)\\)</span>，定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{last}_{555}(\\pi)=(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{last}_{555}(\\pi)=(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-可证性\">7. 可证性</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{555}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{555}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \\operatorname{last}_{555}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{555}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{555}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \\operatorname{last}_{555}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-替换证书\">8. 替换证书</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"555\">\\(555\\)</span>-替换证书为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A,x,t,B)\">\\((A,x,t,B)\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{555}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{555}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{555}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{555}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{555}\">\\(t\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{555}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B=A[x:=t]\">\\(B=A[x:=t]\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"9.-目标区分\">9. 目标区分</h1>\n<p>本条目含一阶项、关系原子、全称绑定与正规盒构造子，但没有等词原子，也没有 Barcan 或 Converse Barcan 公理族。</p>\n<h1 id=\"10.-整个句法形式系统\">10. 整个句法形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{FOML}_{555}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\Sigma_{555},\\mathsf{Var}_{555},\\mathsf{Tm}_{555},\\mathsf{Frm}_{555},\n\\operatorname{FVt}_{555},\\operatorname{FV}_{555},\\operatorname{BV}_{555},\\operatorname{fresh}_{555},\n\\operatorname{Subt}_{555},\\operatorname{Sub}_{555},\n\\operatorname{BoundRen}_{555},\\equiv_{\\alpha,555},\\mathsf{Ax}_{555},\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{555},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Gen}^{555},\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{555},\\mathsf{Proof}_{555},\\vdash_{555}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{FOML}_{555}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\Sigma_{555},\\mathsf{Var}_{555},\\mathsf{Tm}_{555},\\mathsf{Frm}_{555},\n\\operatorname{FVt}_{555},\\operatorname{FV}_{555},\\operatorname{BV}_{555},\\operatorname{fresh}_{555},\n\\operatorname{Subt}_{555},\\operatorname{Sub}_{555},\n\\operatorname{BoundRen}_{555},\\equiv_{\\alpha,555},\\mathsf{Ax}_{555},\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{555},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Gen}^{555},\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{555},\\mathsf{Proof}_{555},\\vdash_{555}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只含一阶模态句法、公理、规则、证明对象和可证性；不含域、世界、可达关系、解释、满足或有效性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-原始签名与显示约定","text":"1. 原始签名与显示约定","level":1},{"id":"2.-项与公式","text":"2. 项与公式","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由变量、替换与-$\\alpha$-等价","text":"3. 自由变量、替换与 $\\alpha$-等价","level":1},{"id":"4.-公理族","text":"4. 公理族","level":1},{"id":"5.-推理规则","text":"5. 推理规则","level":1},{"id":"6.-证明对象","text":"6. 证明对象","level":1},{"id":"7.-可证性","text":"7. 可证性","level":1},{"id":"8.-替换证书","text":"8. 替换证书","level":1},{"id":"9.-目标区分","text":"9. 目标区分","level":1},{"id":"10.-整个句法形式系统","text":"10. 整个句法形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\\quad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:k\\to X\\ (Y=\\{e(i):i<k\\})\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Var}_{555}=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\Sigma_{555}=(\\mathcal F_{555},\\mathcal R_{555},\\operatorname{arF}_{555},\\operatorname{arR}_{555}),","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal F_{555}\\cap\\mathcal R_{555}=\\varnothing,\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{arF}_{555}:\\mathcal F_{555}\\to\\mathbb N,\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{arR}_{555}:\\mathcal R_{555}\\to\\mathbb N.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{var},\\operatorname